 "doc": "The stress flow with float32 directions (pole, antimeridian and signed-zero vortices, a 0.02 and a 1.5 radius). Output float32. Tolerance rtol 1e-4, atol 1e-5: the float64-promoted computation differs by at most 3.5e-7 (0.28 of the default band), a one-ulp nudge of the directions by 1.1e-6 (0.91; the cross product next to a vortex center cancels), reversing the vortex order by 1.2e-7; tolerance 10 times the worst. Values reach 1. Conventions of cloudgen.sphere read here: lonlat_to_dir(lon, lat) = (cos lat cos lon, cos lat sin lon, sin lat) with float64 numpy cos and sin (right-handed, z north, longitude grows east; a vortex center is that direction); normalize(v) = v / |v| (plain division, no epsilon: a zero vector gives NaN).",
